{
  "file": "Guidance for national",
  "page": 90,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        231.10589599609375,
        21.884788513183594,
        277.722412109375,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "Guidance for",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        277.722412109375,
        21.884788513183594,
        349.1717834472656,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "national tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        351.4517822265625,
        21.884788513183594,
        407.7772216796875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "programmes on",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        407.7772216796875,
        21.884788513183594,
        518.984130859375,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "the management of tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        518.984130859375,
        21.884788513183594,
        557.1551513671875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        83.1881103515625,
        513.4374389648438,
        96.53961181640625
      ],
      "text": "Very few second-line drugs are produced in paediatric formulations, and the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        99.18463134765625,
        513.3915405273438,
        112.5361328125
      ],
      "text": "pharmacokinetics are incompletely studied in children. This means that optimal dosing",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        115.18115234375,
        513.3914794921875,
        128.53265380859375
      ],
      "text": "of second-line drugs is unknown and that tablets must be broken or cut, potentially",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        131.17767333984375,
        513.4375610351562,
        144.5291748046875
      ],
      "text": "leading to inaccurate dosages and blood concentrations that are sub-therapeutic or",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        147.1741943359375,
        513.4835815429688,
        160.52569580078125
      ],
      "text": "toxic. The taste of medications is often unpalatable and a number of the drugs can",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        163.17071533203125,
        513.4833374023438,
        176.522216796875
      ],
      "text": "cause vomiting and diarrhoea. This may affect the amount of drug absorbed. Daily",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        179.167236328125,
        513.3685302734375,
        192.51873779296875
      ],
      "text": "injectable drugs are usually given for the first few months of treatment and the pill",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        195.16375732421875,
        513.4950561523438,
        208.5152587890625
      ],
      "text": "burden can be vast. In the experience of a group of multidisciplinary health care",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        211.1602783203125,
        513.4720458984375,
        224.51177978515625
      ],
      "text": "professionals and epidemiologists working within the “The Sentinel Project on Pediatric",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        227.08779907226562,
        513.483642578125,
        240.50830078125
      ],
      "text": "(5,6) Drug-Resistant Tuberculosis”  , spreading the total daily dose over the course of the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        243.1533203125,
        513.4030151367188,
        256.50482177734375
      ],
      "text": "day can improve tolerability but makes directly observed therapy (DOT) challenging.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        259.14984130859375,
        513.460693359375,
        272.5013427734375
      ],
      "text": "Drugs can be mixed with different foods or drinks and, in some situations, nasogastric",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        275.1463623046875,
        431.39642333984375,
        288.49786376953125
      ],
      "text": "or percutaneous endoscopic gastrostomy feeding may be appropriate.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        299.65289306640625,
        513.3685913085938,
        313.00439453125
      ],
      "text": "The number of drugs needed to treat MDR-TB in children has not been prospectively",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        315.6494140625,
        513.46044921875,
        329.00091552734375
      ],
      "text": "evaluated. Some experts suggest that early (paucibacillary) disease, e.g. mediastinal or",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        331.6459045410156,
        513.4606323242188,
        344.9974060058594
      ],
      "text": "hilar lymphadenopathy, with or without limited lung infiltrates, could be treated with",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        347.5733947753906,
        513.4373779296875,
        360.993896484375
      ],
      "text": "(13, 14) fewer drugs and shorter duration of treatment  . However, extensive pulmonary",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        363.6388854980469,
        513.4490356445312,
        376.9903869628906
      ],
      "text": "TB, with or without cavitation, and disseminated extrapulmonary disease should be",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        379.5663757324219,
        260.35687255859375,
        392.98687744140625
      ],
      "text": "(4) treated with four or more drugs  .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        405.85650634765625,
        207.04339599609375,
        422.5845031738281
      ],
      "text": "Duration of treatment",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        426.43072509765625,
        513.4144287109375,
        439.7822265625
      ],
      "text": "There is little evidence on treatment of MDR-TB in children; typically, therefore,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        442.4272155761719,
        513.4719848632812,
        455.7787170410156
      ],
      "text": "programmes treating children with MDR-TB use WHO guidelines for treatment of adult",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        458.3547058105469,
        513.4835815429688,
        471.77520751953125
      ],
      "text": "(2, 10) patients  . Treatment duration depends on the extent of the disease; in most cases",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        474.4201965332031,
        513.3798828125,
        487.7716979980469
      ],
      "text": "the intensive phase will last at least 8 months and total duration of treatment will be at",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        490.3476867675781,
        507.0205383300781,
        503.7681884765625
      ],
      "text": "(2) least 10 months  . All treatment should be given daily and under direct observation.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        514.9231567382812,
        513.448974609375,
        528.274658203125
      ],
      "text": "The optimal duration of treatment for MDR-TB in children is unknown. It may be that",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        530.919677734375,
        513.4605102539062,
        544.2711791992188
      ],
      "text": "children with early, non-extensive disease require treatment for shorter periods than",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        546.8472290039062,
        392.6758728027344,
        560.2677001953125
      ],
      "text": "(4, 11, 13, 14) adults, but this is an area that requires research  .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        573.0989990234375,
        174.1992950439453,
        589.8270263671875
      ],
      "text": "Adverse effects",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        593.604248046875,
        513.4835205078125,
        607.0247192382812
      ],
      "text": "(4, 15) Adverse effects occur less frequently in children than in adults  . The risks and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        609.6697387695312,
        513.448974609375,
        623.021240234375
      ],
      "text": "benefits of each drug should be carefully considered when designing a regimen (Table",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        625.6661987304688,
        513.3799438476562,
        639.0177001953125
      ],
      "text": "10). Caregivers should be made aware of possible adverse events and told to report",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        641.6627197265625,
        513.4719848632812,
        655.0142211914062
      ],
      "text": "immediately any that occur. No second-line anti-TB drugs are absolutely contraindicated",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        657.6592407226562,
        513.4834594726562,
        671.0107421875
      ],
      "text": "in children. Second-line drugs should not be withheld from children unless hypersensitivity",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        673.65576171875,
        513.4833374023438,
        687.0072631835938
      ],
      "text": "or an intractable adverse reaction has been documented. Children who have received",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        689.6522827148438,
        513.4605712890625,
        703.0037841796875
      ],
      "text": "treatment for DR-TB generally tolerate the second-line drugs well. Regular monitoring",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        705.6487426757812,
        513.3798828125,
        719.000244140625
      ],
      "text": "of body weight is important: drug doses need regular adjustment as the child gains",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        721.645263671875,
        513.471923828125,
        734.9967651367188
      ],
      "text": "weight. Baseline audiometry and monthly hearing tests are mandatory if the child is",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        737.6417236328125,
        513.4488525390625,
        750.9932250976562
      ],
      "text": "given any Group 2 injectable agents (particularly if aminoglycosides are administered for",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        753.5692749023438,
        513.4029541015625,
        766.98974609375
      ],
      "text": "(4, 10) a prolonged period), as there is a risk of ototoxicity  . This is especially important",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        769.5657958984375,
        499.11981201171875,
        782.9862670898438
      ],
      "text": "(10) in high-risk patients who are diabetic, living with HIV or have renal insufficiency  .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        558.6439208984375,
        805.8439331054688,
        580.8839111328125,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "71",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
}